810f9b8e", "updated": false}, {"content": "【运维/周宇】上线窗口还没最终确认，回滚演练也没有完成，现在说死日期风险太高。", "create_time": "2026-05-05 14:50", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b50ad7a4b48acc4fe47bc63d9659", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9c1bf5810f9b8e", "updated": false}, {"content": "【安全/林晨】高风险能力在安全评审前不应进入客户承诺口径。", "create_time": "2026-05-05 14:50", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b50ad7a5fd0a8c21c20c4817cde4", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9c1bf5810f9b8e", "updated": false}, {"content": "【研发/赵敏】如果迁移窗口在 5 月 7 日前锁定，内部更合理的目标会变成 5 月 10 日。", "create_time": "2026-05-05 14:50", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b50ad7a513ca4c140ac990b63f91", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9c1bf5810f9b8e", "updated": false}, {"content": "【研发/赵敏】基于当前依赖情况，原来的 5 月 5 日内部目标应改成 5 月 10 日。", "create_time": "2026-05-05 14:50", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b50ad7a6ae0a4c426cab96329149", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9c1bf5810f9b8e", "updated": false}, {"content": "【测试/陈雪】回归高优问题已经收敛，测试 blocker 从红色降到黄色。", "create_time": "2026-05-05 14:50", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b50ad7a7ff0b8c3cc7b692f81979", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9c1bf5810f9b8e", "updated": false}], "updated": true}, {"content"